WEBVTT

00:01.508 --> 00:07.130
This is Samantha. A small AI that lives on your Mac. Free, and private.

00:07.180 --> 00:18.300
She paints from thirty thousand squares. She draws anything you can name.

00:18.350 --> 00:37.251
She runs your Mac. Volume, music, screenshots, your apps.

00:37.301 --> 00:53.943
She keeps your notes, your reminders and your calendar.

00:53.993 --> 01:10.224
She finds your files, reads them, and tells you how big they are.

01:10.274 --> 01:39.891
She does the math, converts units and counts the days.

01:39.941 --> 01:47.511
Ask her anything. On a real Mac she researches with sources, reads your screen and clicks for you. She always asks first.

01:47.561 --> 01:49.508
Free. Private. Download her for Mac.

